      "en": "Many people assembled at Jerusalem to keep the feast of unleavened bread in the second month, a very great assembly.",
      "ko": "이월에 백성이 무교절을 지키려 하여 예루살렘에 많이 모이니 심히 큰 회라",
      "source_text_hash": "c6c0ec5b9d730d8e7d26cfe7e0741e24af8739264af1ab80e1312bc5ba937a47",
