      "en": "They arose and took away the altars that were in Jerusalem, and they took away all the altars for incense and threw them into the brook Kidron.",
      "ko": "무리가 일어나 예루살렘에 있는 제단과 향단들을 모두 제하여 기드론 시내에 던지고",
      "source_text_hash": "9f4dcf9e047233bdbede486fbab04f1a55813aa0ba952ceb66340613417cd5b6",
      "translation_text_hash": "f3e4392631850ea7ac6d5a144501dba42e16e3f228a36646ce677406b3d3783c",
