      "en": "The LORD listened to Hezekiah, and healed the people.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 히스기야의 기도를 들으시고 백성을 고치셨더라",
      "source_text_hash": "123bd8a77a5e73e6232228698b92d48adcd5c7634007e7e21ae652bf53268ce4",
