      "en": "The whole assembly took counsel to keep another seven days, and they kept another seven days with gladness.",
      "ko": "온 회가 다시 칠일을 지키기로 결의하고 이에 또 칠일을 즐거이 지켰더라",
      "source_text_hash": "aaf23fd2c41ddea74c276a381fb48f6e1de1a0a1c53c7554da48d1b66f57d9fe",
